1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Brother of notable Conquistador, Gov. Francisco Vazquez de Coronado y Lujan who was credited with the tremendous exploration into New Mexico, Colorado, Kansas and beyond. Father to Juan Antonio Vazquez de Coronado 
2 CONC y Anaya credited with the exploration and peacefully settling much of the territories known today as Guatamala, El Salvador, Nicaragua and Costa Rica. There were many notable explorers and settlers in this family from Salamanca. 
