2 CONT The more research I am doing I am seeing that Santo Domingo must have been the Ellis Island of the day. Anyone from anywhere within the Spanish empire had to have their papers processed within the Casa de la Contratacion at Isla E
2 CONC spanola. In many cases if the ultimate destination was Mexico, Peru or any of the islands of the Caribbean one had to stop at Isla Espanola.
