2 CONT Menasseh Ben Israel, the brother in law of Jonah, met his sister and merry her at the same day as he married his older sister, Ester. It means the two Ben Israel siblings got married two Abarbanel siblings at the same day.
2 CONT
2 CONT Furthermore, two cousins of the families abouve got married, Samuel Abarbanel, son of Ester and Jona Abarbanel and Gracia Ben israel, daughter of Menasseh ben Israel and Rachel Sarah Abarbanel
2 CONT
2 CONT Died in 1662/7.
