2 CONT == Family ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: 
2 CONT *Gerónimo Ruiz de Corella, IX Conde de Consentayna
2 CONT
2 CONT Jerónima Dávila y Manrique and Gerónimo Ruiz de Corella had two children:
2 CONT *Antonia Dávila y Orella, Marquesa de Consentayna
2 CONT *Juana Davila y Corella
2 CONT
2 CONT Jerónima Dávila y Manrique was the daughter of D. Pedro Davila, III Marques de las Navas, Conde del Risco and Marquesa Da. Juana Manrique.
